GET [https://api.jikan.moe/v4/top/anime?type=movie](https://api.jikan.moe/v4/top/anime?type=movie)

Search/Filter Animated Movies:
GET [https://api.jikan.moe/v4/anime?type=movie&q=YourSearchTerm](https://api.jikan.moe/v4/anime?type=movie&q=YourSearchTerm)

Get Specific Anime Details by ID:
GET [https://api.jikan.moe/v4/anime/](https://api.jikan.moe/v4/anime/){id}

